<title>ESTONIA: Morgan Grenfell to arrange loan for Estonian bank.</title>
<headline>Morgan Grenfell to arrange loan for Estonian bank.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>One of Estonia's biggest banks, Forekspank said on Thursday that it has chosen Deutsche Morgan Grenfell to arrange a syndicated loan of around 20 million German marks.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that the loan would be for a term of three years with an interest rate of Libor plus 175 basis points.</p>
<p>It gave no more details on the timetable for the loan.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
